# The absorbed free-channel pack (13 account channels) carries a Google OAuth
# client id and secret belonging to the project it was copied from. It stays on
# this machine and is copied into the profile by install-to-profile.ps1, but it
# is not committed: this repository is public, and a push would publish someone
# else's credentials. Its LICENSE and NOTICE.md are tracked anyway, so the
# provenance of the vendored server is still on record.
dsh-comprehensive-platform/free-model/vendor/channel-pack/
!dsh-comprehensive-platform/free-model/vendor/channel-pack/LICENSE
!dsh-comprehensive-platform/free-model/vendor/channel-pack/NOTICE.md
tools/.cache/
